        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 32 Inch Black Walnut Laguna Door Pull with Satin Nickel Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 1-1/2 diameter wooden door pull is made out of black walnut. It is 32 inches long. The stand-offs are at 24 inches center to center. The stand offs are finished in satin nickel. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Laguna Wood Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Black Walnut Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Finish Material: Satin Nickel</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 32\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
